## Bound anything that grows
A container that is only ever appended to keeps every entry until the process exits; cap it at what is actually read back.
```python
# bad
recent_errors = []
def record_error(error):
    recent_errors.append(error)
```
```python
# good
from collections import deque
RECENT_ERROR_LIMIT = 20
recent_errors = deque(maxlen=RECENT_ERROR_LIMIT)
def record_error(error):
    recent_errors.append(error)
```
